# The patches are applied byte for byte to the toolkit's sources (LF, a few files with CRLF lines). A checkout with
# core.autocrlf (the Git for Windows default) rewrote them with CRLF and `git apply` refused every one.
patches/*.patch -text
patches/upstream/*.patch -text
# Run by bash (Git Bash / MSYS on Windows), which does not accept CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf
